<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Them Changes - Sped Up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Thundercat</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Them Changes (Sped Up)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6pod2VRHVTven17Da0uZHi</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">5 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Them Changes (Sped Up) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nobody move, there's blood on the floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I can't find my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Where did it go? Did I leave it in the cold?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So please give it back, 'cause it's not yours to take</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It must've fell when I lost my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Deep in the cut, drowning it in pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Somebody help 'cause I can't find my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nobody move, nobody move</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Interlude]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, ooh-ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, ooh-ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ah, ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Somebody tell me how I'm supposed to feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I'm sitting here knowing this ain't real (Ain't real)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why in the world would I give my heart to you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just to watch you throw it in the trash</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been traveling so long, I don't think I can hold on (Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Where werе you when I needed you the most?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm sitting hеre with a black hole in my chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A heartless, broken mess[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh-ooh, ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh-ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(La, la, la, la, la)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh)</p></div></body></tt>